      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 13.97,
      "duration_s": 13.97,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Twenty point five million dollars. That is how much each big college athletic department was allowed to pay its own athletes directly, in the school year that started in twenty twenty-five.",
      "keyframes": [],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "csc"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "s02_twist",
      "segment": "h_twist",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 13.97,
      "end_s": 31.37,
      "duration_s": 17.4,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "For more than a century, college sports ran on one idea. The players were amateurs, and their schools could not pay them a salary. In its first year, the new system paid out about one point seven seven billion dollars to athletes.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In its first year",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.38,
          "absolute_s": 24.35
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In its first year",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.38,
          "absolute_s": 24.35
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "to athletes",
          "label": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 15.94,
          "absolute_s": 29.91
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "csc"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "s03_question",
      "segment": "h_question",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 31.37,
      "end_s": 38.47,
      "duration_s": 7.1,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "So how did college sports suddenly get a payroll? And who ends up paying for it?",
      "keyframes": [],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "s04_promise",
      "segment": "h_promise",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 38.47,
      "end_s": 51.3,
      "duration_s": 12.83,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "By the end of this video, you will know how a court case created this payroll, how the money is split, who checks the deals, and why some smaller sports are paying the price.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].at.cue",
          "cue": "how a court case",
          "label": "items[0].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.42,
          "absolute_s": 41.88
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "who checks",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.14,
          "absolute_s": 46.61
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "smaller sports",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.37,
          "absolute_s": 48.83
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
