    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "s06_case",
      "segment": "m1_case",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 56.7,
      "end_s": 83.2,
      "duration_s": 26.5,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "It started with a class action by college athletes against the NCAA and the biggest conferences. The case was about money from the athletes' names, images and likenesses, including the television deals built on their games. Most of the damages, about two billion dollars, were set aside for exactly that, the athletes' share of name and image money from the past.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "The case was about",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 8.44,
          "absolute_s": 65.14
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Most of the damages",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 17.16,
          "absolute_s": 73.86
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "Most of the damages",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 17.16,
          "absolute_s": 73.86
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "order"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "s07_order",
      "segment": "m1_order",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 83.2,
      "end_s": 104.13,
      "duration_s": 20.93,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "In June twenty twenty-five, federal judge Claudia Wilken gave final approval to a settlement. The back damages alone came to about two point six billion dollars, to be paid every year over ten years, to a class of almost three hundred and ninety thousand current and former athletes.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[3].hits[0].cue",
          "cue": "gave final approval",
          "label": "items[3].hits[0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 4.07,
          "absolute_s": 87.27
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "The back damages",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 7.51,
          "absolute_s": 90.71
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "cue": "every year over ten years",
          "label": "items[1].steps[1][0].cue",
          "scene_time_s": 12.78,
          "absolute_s": 95.98
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "to a class of",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 14.91,
          "absolute_s": 98.12
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "order"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "s08_future",
      "segment": "m1_future",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 104.13,
      "end_s": 125.77,
      "duration_s": 21.63,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "But the real change was about the future. Schools may now share revenue directly with their athletes, up to twenty-two percent of the average athletic revenue of the biggest conferences, with set increases every year. In the first year, that cap was twenty point five million dollars per school.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "Schools may now share",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 3.97,
          "absolute_s": 108.1
        },
        {
          "param": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "In the first year",
          "label": "cam[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.15,
          "absolute_s": 120.28
        },
        {
          "param": "items[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "In the first year",
          "label": "items[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 16.15,
          "absolute_s": 120.28
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "order",
        "csc"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "s09_rises",
      "segment": "m1_rises",
      "type": "engine_cartoon",
      "start_s": 125.77,
      "end_s": 146.27,
      "duration_s": 20.5,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "And it keeps rising. For the twenty twenty-six season, the cap went up to twenty-one point five eight million dollars. The plaintiffs' own expert estimated that by the middle of the next decade, it could approach thirty-three million dollars per school. That is an estimate, not a promise.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "the cap went up",
          "label": "items[0].bars[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 5.3,
          "absolute_s": 131.07
        },
        {
          "param": "items[0].bars[2].at.cue",
          "cue": "own expert estimated",
          "label": "items[0].bars[2].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 10.19,
          "absolute_s": 135.95
        },
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "is an estimate",
          "label": "items[1].at.cue",
          "scene_time_s": 17.79,
          "absolute_s": 143.56
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_cues": [],
      "assets": [
        "font:inter"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "csc",
        "order"
      ],
      "transition_out": "scan"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "p10_pie",
      "segment": "m1_draw",
      "type": "engine_draw",
      "start_s": 146.27,
      "end_s": 168.87,
      "duration_s": 22.6,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Let me draw the pie. Here is a big conference school's athletic revenue, one circle. Television money, tickets, donations. Now cut a slice, up to twenty-two percent. That slice is the payroll. The rest still has to pay for coaches, stadiums, travel and every other team.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
