      "start_s": 246.53,
      "end_s": 267.0,
      "duration_s": 20.47,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "That television money is huge. The Southeastern Conference alone distributed one point zero three billion dollars to its sixteen schools for the twenty twenty-four twenty-five year. For a school in a conference like that, a twenty million dollar payroll is a big bill, but a payable one.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
