      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Look at one of the richest programs. Ohio State reported record athletic revenue of about three hundred and thirty-six million dollars in fiscal year twenty twenty-five, and expenses of about three hundred and twenty million. By our calculation, the difference was about fifteen point seven million dollars. Less than one year's payroll cap.",
