      "end_s": 377.97,
      "duration_s": 21.33,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "Any school may now give a scholarship to every athlete on its roster, if it can afford to. But for walk-ons, the players who joined teams without scholarships, the new limits could mean losing a spot. Athletes who were cut, or would have been, are exempt from the limits for the rest of their college careers.",
      "keyframes": [
        {
          "param": "items[1].at.cue",
          "cue": "for walk-ons",
