      "end_s": 419.53,
      "duration_s": 22.87,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "That raises a legal question. Title IX, the federal law against sex discrimination in education, applies to college sports. The judge said schools are free to divide the money in a way that complies with Title IX, and the settlement does not release Title IX claims. Lawsuits over the split are still pending.",
