      "start_s": 492.07,
      "end_s": 514.8,
      "duration_s": 22.73,
      "visual_objective": "",
      "narration": "The commission's data also showed something telling. In early twenty twenty-six, the value of deals with entities associated with the big schools, often booster groups, rose by three hundred and sixty-four percent. The line between a sponsorship and a disguised salary is exactly what the referee is trying to police.",
